{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《OneThing》是一款專為希望簡化日常、專注單一目標的用家而設的生產力工具。它協助你摒除雜訊，每天只挑選一項最重要的目標，然後鎖定並全力投入。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合容易分心或想培養專注習慣的你。</p>\n\n<h2>聚焦單一目標減輕負擔</h2>\n<p>程式強調「一個目標，而非清單」，透過兩個提問確認目標是否值得投入，完成後可記錄影響程度與困難度，即使放棄也能誠實歸檔。每週歷史紀錄有助檢視進度，配合主畫面小工具、每日提醒與勵志語句，加上無干擾的簡潔設計，讓你專注真正重要的事。所有資料僅儲存於 iPhone，無需帳號、無雲端、無追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1019-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1020-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1021-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1022-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1023-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1024-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：OneThing – One Task</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T15:59:09.654383+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}